# Quality Check Rules

Before finishing any task, check:

Code:
- No TypeScript errors
- No unused imports
- No broken paths
- No duplicated components
- No hardcoded secrets
- No client-side service role usage

UI:
- Mobile responsive
- Clear loading state
- Clear empty state
- Clear error state
- Accessible labels
- Consistent spacing

Security:
- Validate inputs with Zod
- Check role permissions server-side
- Protect dashboard routes
- Avoid exposing private document URLs
- Confirm destructive actions

SEO:
- Metadata exists for public pages
- H1 exists
- Internal links exist
- CTA exists
- Page content is useful

After changes:
- Run npm run lint
- Run npm run build when possible
- Explain what changed
- Mention any remaining risks
